commit_message:
Add an implementation of DynaBean that wraps existing standard JavaBeans with the DynaBean APIs.  Add test cases to make sure that all the tests passed by BasicDynaBean also pass, except for the contains() and remove() method tests -- these methods are not currently supported by the WrapDynaBean implementation. Canonical usage pattern:

  MyAddressClass myBean = ...;
  WrapDynaBean dynaBean = new WrapDynaBean(myBean);
  String name = (String) dynaBean.get("name");
  dynaBean.put("country", "US");


